{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:09 2026-11-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:09 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:09 2026-11-11 HKT</p><img alt=\"工人腳部遭重300公斤紙壓傷送院。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/dd6126e809568587c9e3a2f367780418/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_12_59_23_0.jpeg\"/><p>西貢康定路3號碼頭對開，今（11日）早上11時49分，一名男工人工作期間，據稱被重300公斤的紙砸傷腳，他痛極大叫，驚動工友報警求助，救援人員到場，事主仍然清醒，被送往沙田威爾斯親王醫院治理，警方將案列工業意外跟進調查。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8117985ea4570eb83850f66b368d751b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_12_59_23.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工人清醒送院治理。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cda8e6c4e2b7347a0896f0dc98741baf/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_12_59_22.jpeg\" title=\"工人清醒送院治理。楊偉亨攝\"/><p>工人清醒送院治理。楊偉亨攝</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:33:16.087518+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:09:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T05:26:30.872512+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:26:30.872512+00:00","content_hash":"946b5a020fb7389c9eebcc6d484b9a3bfea664252359d653271de3d0705ccfea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}